# Apple HIG UI lock

- Opaque nav and content chrome. No decorative glass on sidebars, bottom bars, or content cards.
- Glass only on functional overlays (sheets, alerts, pickers), inside `@supports`, with solid fallback.
- Do not invent new UI CSS outside the project kit / tokens.
- Do not add status badges on dense list rows unless the product explicitly requires them.
- Preserve brand colors and fonts from DESIGN.md.
